From 187593e8f79cfc92b2170c92b729e9076fd5f244 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Takuro Ashie <ashie@clear-code.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:53:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] omxbufferpool: Retire shared OMX buffers on a cleanup
 worker

Keep imported buffers alive until shared memories return, reserve the
retiring port against reuse and perform OMX teardown on a detached
worker instead of the memory-return thread. Retain resources on unsafe
teardown failures rather than freeing memory still used by OMX. This
workaround depends on the operation-deadline helpers.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Takuro Ashie <ashie@clear-code.com>
---
